SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This license covers the Serge configuration layer only: the constitution
scaffold, hook and helper scripts, subagent definitions, skills, slash
commands, router configuration, service units, installer, and documentation
contained in this repository.

It does NOT cover the engine.

Serge is designed to run on a CLI derived from Anthropic's Claude Code. That
code is proprietary software:

  Copyright (c) Anthropic PBC. All rights reserved.
  Subject to Anthropic's Commercial Terms of Service.

This repository does not contain, vendor, or distribute that code, and the MIT
grant above does not extend to it. If you bundle an engine with a fork of this
repository, you are making a distribution decision about someone else's
proprietary software — evaluate your own legal position first.
